## 🎯 Overview

**CoworkSpace Manager Pro** is a SaaS application designed to simplify the daily operations of coworking spaces and shared office facilities.

Managing a coworking business involves coordinating multiple activities:

- Workspace availability and reservations.
- Customer relationships and information.
- Contracts and service agreements.
- Invoice generation and payment records.
- Financial reporting and business performance.

CoworkSpace Manager Pro brings these operations together within a centralized web application.

The project explores how modern web technologies can improve operational efficiency, reduce repetitive administrative tasks, and provide better visibility into business activity.

### The Goal

**Manage Spaces → Handle Bookings → Organize Clients → Track Billing → Analyze Performance**

---

## ✨ Features

### 📊 Management Dashboard

A centralized dashboard providing an overview of coworking business operations.

- Revenue indicators.
- Daily booking statistics.
- Customer information.
- Available and active spaces.
- Active contracts.
- Pending invoices.
- Business performance indicators.

The dashboard retrieves information through backend API endpoints.

### 🏢 Workspace Management

Manage different types of shared working environments.

Supported workspace categories include:

- Private offices.
- Meeting rooms.
- Coworking desks.
- Event spaces.

**Management capabilities:**

- Create and update workspace records.
- Configure capacity and pricing.
- Set hourly, daily, and monthly rates.
- Organize available amenities.
- Track workspace availability and status.

### 📅 Booking Management

A reservation management system for coworking facilities.

- Create and manage bookings.
- Associate bookings with clients and spaces.
- Configure reservation dates and times.
- Check workspace availability.
- Track booking status.
- Manage check-in and check-out.
- View booking statistics.

The backend provides dedicated reservation management endpoints.

### 👥 Customer Relationship Management

A CRM module designed to organize customer information and related business activities.

- Customer profiles.
- Contact details.
- Company information.
- VAT identification information.
- Booking relationships.
- Contract associations.
- Customer activity records.

The objective is to make customer data accessible and manageable from a single interface.

### 📝 Contract Management

A dedicated module for managing coworking service agreements.

- Create and organize contracts.
- Associate agreements with clients.
- Store contract terms.
- Track contract dates.
- Monitor agreement status.
- Manage contract records.

### 💰 Billing & Invoice Management

An integrated invoicing module designed to support administrative workflows.

- Create invoice records.
- Associate invoices with customers.
- Link invoices to bookings.
- Calculate invoice amounts and taxes.
- Track payment status.
- Identify pending and overdue invoices.
- View billing statistics.

**Note:** Invoice management does not imply active payment processing. The project is currently intended for demonstration and development.

### 📈 Reporting & Analytics

Business reporting components built around operational data.

- Revenue analysis.
- Occupancy reporting.
- Booking statistics.
- Customer activity analysis.
- Workspace performance.
- Date-based reporting.
- Charts and visualizations.
- Reporting export endpoint.

These components help operators evaluate business activity and identify operational trends.

### 🔐 Authentication & Access Control

- User authentication using JWT.
- Password hashing with bcryptjs.
- Protected application routes.
- Role-based authorization.
- Administrative and operational user roles.

Supported roles in the database include:

- Administrator.
- Manager.
- Receptionist.
- Maintenance.

### 🌍 Multilingual Interface

The frontend includes internationalization support using i18next and React i18next.

